8. Push changes: Finally, push the merged changes to your remote repository:

   ```
   git push origin branch-name
   ```

9. Confirm successful merge: Verify that the merge was successful by checking your GitHub repository or the remote tracking branch of your local repository in Git.

That's it! You have now successfully resolved merge conflicts in GitHub.

